'''Greater nechryael''' are stronger variants of [[nechryael]] that require level 80 [[Slayer]] to harm, plus completion of [[Priest in Peril]] to be assigned as a [[Slayer task]]. [[Krystilia]] will only assign them if ''[[I Wildy More Slayer]]'' is unlocked. They are found within the [[Catacombs of Kourend]], [[Iorwerth Dungeon]] and the [[Wilderness Slayer Cave]].

Like normal nechryael, greater nechryael can summon up to two [[Death spawn|Death spawns]] when fighting a player. These death spawns are the same as the ones summoned by normal nechryael. Using [[Protect from Melee]] is recommended, as the greater nechryael is more accurate and deals even more damage. [[Emberlight]] can be very effective against greater nechryael, as these are considered to be [[demons|demonic creatures]].

Unlike the [[twisted banshee]], [[mutated bloodveld]], [[deviant spectre]] and [[warped jelly|warped jellies]], who have unique superior creatures compared to their standard counterparts, greater nechryael do not. They simply get the normal [[nechryarch]] instead, although its drop table is adjusted accordingly.

